# Optional. Local editing and image/JSON export work without this value.
# Create your own Web OAuth client in Google Cloud. For consumer Gmail accounts,
# set the app audience to External and add your account as a test user while the
# app is in Testing. Register the exact development origin (for example,
# http://localhost:4173) under Authorized JavaScript origins.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
